# Share key → defaults

When the user pastes a `monitron:1:[<screenId>]:…` key and wants it as screen defaults:

1. Run (do not re-implement decrypt inline):

```bash
npm run decode-share -- '<full-key>'
```

Script: `scripts/decode-share.mjs` (same seal as `lib/screenShare.ts`).

2. Map the JSON into that screen’s `*_DEFAULTS` / `STORED_DEFAULTS` (skip `_` HUD chrome; audio fields live on `STORED_DEFAULTS` when the screen has them).
